# Task 02: Web Application Security – SQL Injection (SQLi)

## 📌 Executive Summary
This project demonstrates hands-on web application auditing and exploitation using **Burp Suite Community Edition** as an intercepting proxy on Kali Linux. The goal was to identify, analyze, and exploit a SQL Injection (SQLi) vulnerability within an un-sanitized product category filter, forcing the backend database to display hidden and unreleased catalog items.

---

